  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Summon Spectral Fence"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I can "
        },
        {
          "text": "conjure a phantasmal fence",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " that will block most creatures from passing through it for a short duration, but it will allow nonliving things and other people through. \n\nI'm able to effortlessly maintain the fences as long as I or any other person is close to it, But otherwise it will fade after twenty seconds."
        },
        {
          "text": "\n\nIf I cast this spell on a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Metal Ritual Rune",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the effect will become permanent at that location, until broken manually."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
